@startuml Kode_Voucher
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Kode Voucher (Apply Voucher Code)
actor Customer
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB

Customer -> App: Di Checkout Screen / Cart\nMasukkan Kode Voucher
App -> App: Validasi Format Code
App -> API: POST /api/vouchers/validate
note right of App
    Request Body:
    - voucher_code
    - total_amount
    - customer_id
end note

API -> DB: Query Voucher by Code
DB --> API: Return Voucher Data

alt Voucher Valid
    API -> API: Check Voucher Conditions:\n- Expiry Date\n- Min Purchase\n- Max Usage\n- Customer Eligibility

    alt All Conditions Met
        API -> DB: Log Voucher Usage
        DB --> API: Success
        API --> App: Response 200\n(Diskon Amount, Discount Type)
        App -> App: Calculate New Total
        App --> Customer: Tampilkan Success\n("Voucher Applied: Rp XXX discount")
        App -> App: Update UI (New Total Amount)
    else Conditions Failed
        API --> App: Response 400\n(Error Message)
        App --> Customer: Tampilkan Error\n("Voucher tidak valid/expired/max usage")
    end
else Voucher Not Found
    API --> App: Response 404
    App --> Customer: Tampilkan Error\n("Kode voucher tidak ditemukan")
end

@enduml